<section class="page-intro"><a class="breadcrumb" href="<%- url_for('/') %>">首页 / 题解菜单</a><span class="eyebrow">THE WRITEUP MENU</span><h1 class="page-title"><%= page.categoryName ? `${page.categoryName}，请慢用。` : '解开一道，再来一道。' %></h1><p>把解题时的弯路和灵光一现，整理成可以重温的记录。</p></section>
<div class="content-layout"><section class="posts-panel" data-post-browser data-default-filter="<%= page.categoryName || 'all' %>"><label class="search-box" id="search"><%- icon('search') %><input type="search" id="post-search" placeholder="搜索题目、标签、赛事或学习记录…" aria-label="搜索题解" autocomplete="off"><kbd>/</kbd></label><div class="filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="筛选题解方向"><a class="filter-chip<%= !page.categoryName ? ' is-active' : '' %>" href="<%- url_for('/writeups/') %>" data-filter="all">全部 <span><%= blog().posts.length %></span></a><% blog().directions.forEach(direction => { %><a class="filter-chip<%= page.categoryName === direction.name ? ' is-active' : '' %>" data-filter="<%= direction.name %>" href="<%- url_for(`/categories/${direction.name}/`) %>"><%= direction.name %><span><%= direction.count %></span></a><% }) %></div><div class="results-toolbar"><span>共 <strong data-result-count><%= blog().posts.length %></strong> 篇记录</span><label class="source-selector">来源<select id="source-filter" aria-label="筛选文章来源"><option value="all">全部来源</option><% [...new Set(blog().posts.map(post => post.source_event || '散题'))].sort().forEach(event => { %><option value="<%= event %>"><%= event %></option><% }) %></select></label></div><div class="post-list"><% blog().posts.forEach((post,index) => { %><%- partial('_partial/post-card',{post,index}) %><% }) %></div><div class="empty-state glass-card" hidden><%- icon('search') %><h3>这份口味还没找到</h3><p>试试别的关键词，或切换到全部方向。</p><button class="button button-ghost" data-reset-search>清除筛选</button></div></section><%- partial('_partial/sidebar') %></div>
